{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"The scope control executed and the identity finding's boundary is now measured, not argued. Receipt 78c53df3891643edafaa4f10d60ea5d1 (experiment 1660067f6fc64af7a72dcbb7428e8a53-experiment, exit 0, both cases passed, no parse loss) carries both sides in one run: event 1 `overwritten_index_resolution` {a_decided_idx:1, a_entry_at_index_1_is_own:false, b_idx:1, resolution:\\\"Ok(1)\\\"} — the caller's entry was accepted only locally, was replaced at its index, and its call still resolved Ok(1); event 2 `adopted_entry_resolution` {a_decided_before:0, a_decided_idx:1, a_entry_at_index_1_is_own:true, b_decided_idx:1, resolution:\\\"Ok(1)\\\"} — with both followers accepting the entry (receipts dropped, so the caller stayed at decided 0 with its call pending) the next leader adopted the log and the same call's Ok was truthful; event 0 records the state in which the substitution happens. The account therefore holds with a measured scope: the false completion needs the entry not to be adopted by the following leader, while adopted entries are reported truthfully, consistent with the prepare-phase Promise log_sync / take_max_promise_sync adoption path. The question's discriminator was updated to the answer plus what would still change the judgment, and a mistyped receipt id in that prose was corrected (the account itself unchanged). Final state of the audit: three supported findings with receipts and honest limits — the runtime's unconsumed bounded event stream parks the actor loop and, once enough nodes park, stalls the cluster (measured at capacities 8, 64 and the shipped default 1024, under a transport that cannot jam behind a parked destination); the core has no timer-driven repair for a lost Accepted reply, leaving a quorum-accepted entry undecided for at least 100 resend periods in the 2-node case and requiring a later proposal or a ballot change; and append_notify can resolve Ok(idx) for an entry that was never decided there, shadowing the documented Superseded heuristic, bounded to entries the following leader did not adopt.\"}"}}
